---
// Recreated CRT phosphor-glowing code display + JP3N coding practices
---

<div class="coding-showcase">
  <div class="coding-grid">
    <!-- Left: Recreated CRT Phosphor-Glow Code Screen (Pure HTML + CSS) -->
    <div class="crt-code-frame">
      <div class="crt-scanlines" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="crt-vignette" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <pre class="crt-code" aria-label="JP3N First-Principles Engineering Code"><code><span class="c-cmt">// JP3N Tech Dwelling</span>
<span class="c-cmt">// main.cpp — first-principles runtime</span>
<span class="c-inc">#include</span> <span class="c-str">"atelier.h"</span> <span class="c-cmt">// zero-bloat core</span>

<span class="c-kw">int</span> <span class="c-fn">main</span>()
<span class="c-punc">&#123;</span>
    <span class="c-cmt">// Allocate clean static architecture</span>
    <span class="c-type">Atelier</span>* <span class="c-var">craft</span> = <span class="c-kw">new</span> <span class="c-type">Atelier</span>();

    <span class="c-cmt">// Loop while shipping production systems</span>
    <span class="c-kw">while</span> (<span class="c-var">craft</span>-&gt;<span class="c-fn">is_shipping</span>())
    <span class="c-punc">&#123;</span>
        <span class="c-var">craft</span>-&gt;<span class="c-fn">strip_framework_bloat</span>();

        <span class="c-cmt">// Core engineering invariants</span>
        <span class="c-kw">if</span> (<span class="c-var">craft</span>-&gt;<span class="c-fn">static_html</span>() &amp;&amp; <span class="c-var">craft</span>-&gt;<span class="c-fn">zero_trackers</span>() &amp;&amp;
            <span class="c-var">craft</span>-&gt;<span class="c-fn">wcag_aa</span>() &amp;&amp; <span class="c-var">craft</span>-&gt;<span class="c-fn">sub_second_lcp</span>())
        <span class="c-punc">&#123;</span>
            <span class="c-cmt">// Ship clean, deterministic software</span>
            <span class="c-var">craft</span>-&gt;<span class="c-var">production_ready</span> = <span class="c-kw">true</span>;
            <span class="c-var">craft</span>-&gt;<span class="c-fn">deploy_to_edge</span>();
        <span class="c-punc">&#125;</span>
        <span class="c-kw">else</span>
        <span class="c-punc">&#123;</span>
            <span class="c-cmt">// Refactor until simple &amp; fast</span>
            <span class="c-var">craft</span>-&gt;<span class="c-fn">audit_bottlenecks</span>();
            <span class="c-var">craft</span>-&gt;<span class="c-var">production_ready</span> = <span class="c-kw">false</span>;
        <span class="c-punc">&#125;</span>
    <span class="c-punc">&#125;</span>

    <span class="c-cmt">// Clean teardown, zero leaked state</span>
    <span class="c-kw">delete</span> <span class="c-var">craft</span>;
    <span class="c-kw">return</span> <span class="c-num">0</span>;
<span class="c-punc">&#125;</span></code></pre>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: What We Do About Coding -->
    <div class="coding-details">
      <span class="coding-kicker">WEB LABORATORY // CODING DISCIPLINE</span>
      <h2 class="coding-title">How We Write &amp; Ship Code</h2>
      <p class="coding-lead">
        We treat software as durable engineering—not disposable framework glue. Every line we write is audited for runtime cost, clarity, and long-term maintainability.
      </p>

      <div class="coding-pillars">
        <div class="pillar-item">
          <span class="pillar-num">01</span>
          <div class="pillar-body">
            <h3>Zero-Bloat Static &amp; Systems Architecture</h3>
            <p>We compile web platforms to pure static HTML with Astro and TypeScript, and build native CLI/backend tooling in Rust, Go, Java, and Python.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-item">
          <span class="pillar-num">02</span>
          <div class="pillar-body">
            <h3>Client-Only &amp; Privacy-First Execution</h3>
            <p>Utilities like ByteSift and pregnantbattery run 100% locally in browser memory—zero tracking pixels, zero telemetry beacons, and zero unnecessary server round-trips.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-item">
          <span class="pillar-num">03</span>
          <div class="pillar-body">
            <h3>Deterministic Design Tokens &amp; Accessibility</h3>
            <p>All UI styling is driven by semantic CSS custom properties with verified WCAG AA contrast, semantic HTML landmarks, and keyboard-first navigation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-item">
          <span class="pillar-num">04</span>
          <div class="pillar-body">
            <h3>Automated QA &amp; Clean Repositories</h3>
            <p>Typed schemas, CI/CD pipelines, Espresso/BrowserStack mobile verification, and documented open-source repositories built for real contributors.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .coding-showcase {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .coding-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 980px) {
    .coding-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;
      gap: var(--space-3xl);
    }
  }

  /* CRT Phosphor-Glow Code Screen */
  .crt-code-frame {
    position: relative;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 45% 45%, #0c120d 0%, #040705 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline-bright);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 0 42px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9),
      0 22px 44px -14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
  }

  .crt-scanlines {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 0px,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 2px,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28) 3px,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28) 4px
    );
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 3;
  }

  .crt-vignette {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 52%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.72) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 4;
  }

  .crt-code {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(0.68rem, 1.05vw, 0.82rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    overflow-x: auto;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  /* CRT Phosphor Syntax Halation */
  .c-cmt {
    color: var(--text-accent-soft);
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.82;
    text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(164, 172, 134, 0.25);
  }

  .c-inc {
    color: #e07a5f;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(224, 122, 95, 0.55);
  }

  .c-str {
    color: var(--text-accent);
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--theme-accent-glow);
  }

  .c-kw {
    color: #ff6b6b;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.55);
  }

  .c-type {
    color: #ffd166;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 209, 102, 0.5);
  }

  .c-fn {
    color: var(--text-accent);
    text-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--theme-accent-glow);
  }

  .c-var {
    color: #ffd166;
    text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 209, 102, 0.4);
  }

  .c-num {
    color: #72efdd;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(114, 239, 221, 0.5);
  }

  .c-punc {
    color: #72efdd;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* Right Column: Coding Details */
  .coding-kicker {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--text-accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .coding-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-s);
  }

  .coding-lead {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .coding-pillars {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-m);
  }

  .pillar-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    background-color: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    transition: border-color 150ms ease;
  }

  .pillar-item:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-hairline-bright);
  }

  .pillar-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-accent);
    padding-top: 2px;
  }

  .pillar-body h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .pillar-body p {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
